# Agent and sprint instruction files — genuinely ephemeral one-off task
# orders, kept out of git on purpose. (BACKLOG.md/WORKLOG.md used to be
# lumped in here too — moved below. "Not in git" has meant "gone forever"
# twice now when a VM died with uncommitted state, so anything that's a
# standing project record rather than a disposable task order belongs in
# version control instead.)
AGENT_*.md
PROMPT_*.md
NOTES_*.md

